WEBVTT

00:00:03.380 --> 00:00:06.030
Dental Data follows a simple rule:

00:00:06.080 --> 00:00:10.430
Microsoft inside the node, open
standards at the borders.

00:00:10.480 --> 00:00:14.470
Inside each node, the connector
runs on Microsoft Azure,

00:00:14.520 --> 00:00:17.810
with the data in the European
Union, integrated with the

00:00:17.860 --> 00:00:21.730
practice management software and
deployed by Azure partners.

00:00:21.780 --> 00:00:25.810
At the borders, the space speaks
open European standards:

00:00:25.860 --> 00:00:28.610
Gaia-X, the dataspace protocol,

00:00:28.660 --> 00:00:36.150
Eclipse EDC, verifiable credentials,
FHIR, DICOM and HealthDCAT-AP.

00:00:36.200 --> 00:00:39.890
So any participant can connect,
even without Microsoft.

00:00:39.940 --> 00:00:42.930
And we are not starting from
scratch: Software in a

00:00:42.980 --> 00:00:47.310
Box has already designed and run
three real data spaces.

00:00:47.360 --> 00:00:52.260
In France, the node is also available on a
certified sovereign provider.
